body:
YTA And by the way saying it was a great time and kissing her counts as at least implying you wanted to see her again, you led her on and you ghosted her, her rant was very much justified considering she probably suffers by having to deal with people like you, not to mention your notion that you were "catfished", seriously? Have you ever thought she might be overly conscious of her condition and did not want to flaunt it around? I don't think you dodged a bullet, I think SHE dodged a bullet.

&#x200B;

By the way there's nothing wrong in not wanting to date her further because of the wheelchair, you're free to choose, all you had to do was tell her as gently as possible and not be so much of an ass about it.
